ge: http://the-agent-company.com:8929/\\\\n2. Click the notification banner \\\\\"Create merge request\\\\\" link\\\\n3. Review pre-populated merge request form:\\\\n   - Source branch: feature/nonVerbalAgent\\\\n   - Target branch: main\\\\n   - Title: from commit message\\\\n   - Description: from commit message\\\\n4. Click \\\\\"Create merge request\\\\\" button\\\\n\\\\n### 7. Verify Merge Request\\\\n- Check merge request ID appears in URL (e.g., /merge_requests/217)\\\\n- Verify status is \\\\\"Open\\\\\" and \\\\\"Ready to merge\\\\\"\\\\n- Confirm all changes are correctly displayed\\\\n\\\\n## Key Implementation Details\\\\n- NonVerbalAgent restricts actions to non-verbal communication only\\\\n- Uses action filtering to prevent verbal communication\\\\n- Maintains compatibility with existing agent architecture\\\\n- Follows Sotopia code patterns and conventions\\\\n\\\\n## Notes\\\\n- The merge request will be automatically marked as \\\\\"Ready to merge\\\\\" if no conflicts exist\\\\n- Delete source branch option is enabled by default\\\\n- No additional approval workflows are configured by default\\\\n\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'GitLab', 'operation': 'CreateNonVerbalAgentFeature'}), CmdRunAction(command='find /workspace -name \"sotopia\" -type d 2>/dev/null | head -5', is_input=False, thought='Perfect! I have a detailed SOP to follow. Let me start by checking if the Sotopia repository is already cloned in the workspace:', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='/workspace/sotopia\\n/workspace/sotopia/sotopia', command='find /workspace -name \"sotopia\" -type d 2>/dev/null | head -5', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d98