ge: http://the-agent-company.com:8929/\\n2. Click the notification banner \"Create merge request\" link\\n3. Review pre-populated merge request form:\\n   - Source branch: feature/nonVerbalAgent\\n   - Target branch: main\\n   - Title: from commit message\\n   - Description: from commit message\\n4. Click \"Create merge request\" button\\n\\n### 7. Verify Merge Request\\n- Check merge request ID appears in URL (e.g., /merge_requests/217)\\n- Verify status is \"Open\" and \"Ready to merge\"\\n- Confirm all changes are correctly displayed\\n\\n## Key Implementation Details\\n- NonVerbalAgent restricts actions to non-verbal communication only\\n- Uses action filtering to prevent verbal communication\\n- Maintains compatibility with existing agent architecture\\n- Follows Sotopia code patterns and conventions\\n- Includes both regular and script-writing variants\\n\\n## Notes\\n- The merge request will be automatically marked as \"Ready to merge\" if no conflicts exist\\n- Delete source branch option is enabled by default\\n- No additional approval workflows are configured by default\\n- Successfully tested with merge request #217\\n'}, thought='Perfect! The task has been successfully completed. Let me now update the SOP guide with this successful experience:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CreateNonVerbalAgentFeature\\' for platform \\'GitLab\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'GitLab', 'operation': 'CreateNonVerbalAgentFeature', 'details': '# GitLab: Create NonVerbalAgent Feature Branch and Merge Request SOP\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP outlines the process for creating a new feature branch, implementing a NonVerbalAgent, and creating a merge request in the Sotopia repository.\\n\\n## Prerequisites\\n- GitLab credentials (username: root, password: theagentcompany)\\n- Access to the Sotopia repository at http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia\\n- Git repository cloned locally\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Create Feature Branch\\n```bash\\ngit checkout -b feature/nonVerbalAgent\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Implement NonVerbalAgent\\n- Create `/workspace/sotopia/sotopia/agents/nonverbal_agent.py` with the following key features:\\n  - Extends `BaseAgent[Observation, AgentAction]`\\n  - Filters available actions to only allow \"none\" and \"non-verbal communication\"\\n  - Forces non-verbal communication if model generates other action types\\n  - Uses the same structure as LLMAgent for consistency\\n  - Includes NonVerbalScriptWritingAgent for script-like scenarios\\n\\n### 3. Update Module Exports\\n- Edit `/workspace/sotopia/sotopia/agents/__init__.py` to include NonVerbalAgent and NonVerbalScriptWritingAgent in exports\\n\\n### 4. Commit Changes\\n```bash\\ngit add sotopia/agents/__init__.py sotopia/agents/nonverbal_agent.py\\ngit commit -m \"feat: add NonVerbalAgent that can only issue non-verbal communication\"\\n```\\n\\n### 5. Push to GitLab\\n```bash\\ngit push origin feature/nonVerbalAgent\\n```\\n- When prompted, enter GitLab credentials (root/theagentcompany)\\n\\n### 6. Create Merge Request via GitLab UI\\n1. Navigate to GitLab homepage: http://the-agent-company.com:8929/\\n2. Click the notification banner \"Create merge request\" link\\n3. Review pre-populated merge request form:\\n   - Source branch: feature/nonVerbalAgent\\n   - Target branch: main\\n   - Title: from commit message\\n   - Description: from commit message\\n4. Click \"Create merge request\" button\\n\\n### 7. Verify Merge Request\\n- Check merge request ID appears in URL (e.g., /merge_requests/217)\\n- Verify status is \"Open\" and \"Ready to merge\"\\n- Confirm all changes are correctly displayed\\n\\n## Key Implementation Details\\n- NonVerbalAgent restricts actions to non-verbal communication 